{{ macros.section(2, "DSLs", id="dsls") }}

DSLs[^dsl] in CMK are a first-class concept that can help to create, embed, and manage arbitrary "sub-languages".  This is related to the concept of *bound or unbound code objects* that is [also supported]({{_}}/cmk/concepts/#machines), but DSLs are the more flexible, powerful, and structured approach.  See the [concepts page]({{_}}/cmk/concepts/#dsls) for a quick summary, or read on for more involved discussion and examples.

